  <releases>
    <release version="0.3.3" date="2026-08-28">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Zarestia-Dev/rclone-manager/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md</url>
      <description>
        <p>Security and reliability release.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Send-to file-manager entries escape the remote name and path, which could otherwise execute as shell code.</li>
          <li>The generated GNOME Files context-menu extension was invalid Python and never loaded.</li>
          <li>Split view no longer deletes or renames the matching file in the other pane.</li>
          <li>Multi-rename no longer crashes on non-ASCII file names.</li>
          <li>Settings and store files are written atomically and owner-readable only.</li>
          <li>The Check Results panel shows results again, and folders whose names contain a colon are reachable.</li>
          <li>The application now installs its own icon instead of falling back to a generic one.</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.3.2" date="2026-08-24">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Zarestia-Dev/rclone-manager/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md</url>
      <description>
        <p>Flow overlay, Quick Runs, modular dashboard panels, and a theme-aware tray icon.</p>
      </description>
    </release>
  </releases>
